  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "からだを　ぶつけて　こうげき。\nぼうぎょが　たかいほど\nあたえる　ダメージが　ふえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몸을 부딪쳐서 공격한다.\n방어가 높을수록\n주는 데미지가 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用身體撞向對手進行攻擊。\n自己的防禦越高，\n給予對手的傷害越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur utilise son corps pour attaquer sa cible.\nPlus la Défense du lanceur est élevée,\nplus les dégâts infligés sont importants.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift mit seinem ganzen Körper an.\nJe höher seine Verteidigung ist, desto mehr Schaden\nrichtet er an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario usa el cuerpo para lanzar su ataque e infligir\nun daño directamente proporcional a su Defensa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa schiaccia il bersaglio con il suo corpo.\nPiù la sua Difesa è alta, maggiori sono i danni inflitti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks by slamming its body into the target.\nThe higher the user’s Defense, the more damage it can\ninflict on the target.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "体を　ぶつけて　攻撃。\n防御が　高いほど\n与える　ダメージが　増える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用身体撞向对手进行攻击。\n防御越高，\n给予的伤害就越高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario usa el cuerpo para lanzar su ataque e infligir\nun daño directamente proporcional a su Defensa.",
